## What Claude Code did most recently (June 12 2026)

### Hero audit & fixes — replaced wrong header styles on 5 pages

After a full Figma deep-dive (nodes: Leadership `7326-1671`, Board `7326-2209`, Newsroom `7391-1326`, Client Resources `7326-3981`, Products `6932-106`), identified and fixed 5 pages using the wrong hero pattern:

- **LeadershipPage.jsx** — replaced plain centered white `<section>` hero with `<PageHero image="assets/hero-couple.jpg" eyebrow="Leadership" ...>` + CTA "Board of Directors"
- **BoardPage.jsx** — replaced plain centered white `<section>` hero with `<PageHero image="assets/lighthouse.jpg" eyebrow="Board of Directors" ...>` + CTA "Leadership"
- **NewsroomPage.jsx** — replaced plain centered white `<section>` hero with `<PageHero image="assets/hero-overlay.jpg" eyebrow="Newsroom" ...>`
- **ClientResourcesPage.jsx** — replaced plain centered white `<section>` hero with `<PageHero image="assets/AdobeStock_1231908414@0.3x.jpg" eyebrow="Client Resources" ...>`; improved copy: "Everything you need / to serve clients well."
- **ProductsPage.jsx** — had `PageHero` already but with About-page copy; fixed to Products-specific: "Annuities designed to / protect and grow your savings."

All four pages also received `import PageHero from './PageHero.jsx'` where missing.

**Build status:** `npm run build` passes clean ✅

