### About page (`#about`) — CompanyPage.jsx — REBUILT FROM FIGMA

**Figma source:** `node-id=7391-6795` in file `fe7PYQtVJ2pNZ1VR6lznWz`

**Old structure (replaced):**
- PageHero → Company story (2-col) → "Why Oceanview" navy 3×2 pillar grid → AM Best watermark section → CTABanner

**New structure (matches Figma):**
1. `PageHero` — ocean image, "Retirement solutions designed for clarity and confidence"
2. **"Experience the Difference"** — 2-col: left has eyebrow/h2/body/teal checklist card (5 bold-label bullet points)/closing body; right is 480×480 photo (`older-couple-1.png`, rounded 16px)
3. **"Our Mission & Our Approach"** — equal 2-col: each has eyebrow label, 26px heading, body, teal checklist card with 4 items
4. **"Our Story"** — photo left (`couple-walking.png`, 420×420, rounded 24px), content right (eyebrow "Since 1987", h2, company narrative, "Meet Our Leadership" ghost pill + "Read our 2024 Annual Report" text link)
5. **AM Best** — content left (eyebrow "Financial Strength", h2 with `#2494c1` italic accent, body, text link); photo right (`hero-beach-couple.jpg`, 420×420, rounded 24px)
6. **CTA card** — teal `rgba(112,186,191,0.2)` rounded card, centered, "Not sure which product is right for you?", navy "Get Started" pill button → navigates to `#contact`

**New CSS classes added to `tokens.css`** (responsive via `@media (max-width: 960px)`):
- `.ov-about-diff-grid` — section 2 flex row
- `.ov-about-diff-photo` — section 2 right photo
- `.ov-about-features-grid` — section 3 two-col
- `.ov-about-story-grid` — section 4 two-col
- `.ov-about-story-photo` — section 4 photo
- `.ov-about-ambest-grid` — section 5 two-col
- `.ov-about-ambest-photo` — section 5 photo
- `.ov-about-cta-card` — section 6 card

**Build status:** `npm run build` passes clean ✅

